   </div>
   <div class="br"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><div class="url"><span class="u1">evals.yourcompany.com/#/</span><span class="u2">evals.yourcompany.com/#/compare</span><span class="u3">evals.yourcompany.com/#/result/c3a1f0d2-58e4-4b7a-9d16-0e2b7f4a9c51</span></div></div>
